  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Project Resources**\n\nI\'ve decided to incorporate `react-router-dom`, `recharts`, and `canvas-confetti` into the project, including their type definitions if available. I\'m now carefully reviewing the user-provided images, focusing on each one to ensure I understand their potential integration points. The first image presents a dashboard overview with a prominent Indian national emblem or shield as a logo in the header.\n\n\n**Analyzing Dashboard Layout**\n\nI\'m now diving into the dashboard image details. I\'ve pinpointed the key components: the \"MPLADS Sentinel\" header, the central search bar, and the navigation tabs. I\'m taking notes on the KPI stat cards \342\200\223 total projects, allocated funds, expenditure, and risk factors. The interactive map for \"National Risk Distribution\" with its legend is a priority. I am considering layout for a good User Experience.\n\n\n**Defining Chart Parameters**\n\nI\'m now focusing on visual elements. I\'m planning out the \"Financial Trends\" chart \342\200\223 a bar/line combo. I\'m thinking Recharts for this; the legend will sit top right. I\'m also planning the \"Project Status\" bar breakdown, with its color scheme, as a Rechart component. A floating AI assistant button is being considered for the bottom right of the page.\n\n\n**Detailing Project Cards**\n\nI\'m now deep in the individual project card details. I am paying close attention to the Ref code, MP name, and sector badges, along with financial information including the progress bar. Status, risk, and action buttons are all crucial components I must account for. Pagination is also being considered to ensure proper viewing of entries.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Examining Risk Analysis**\n\nI\'m now turning my focus to the risk analysis section. I\'ve noted the active \"Risk Analysis\" header and the descriptive title, along with those two action buttons. System insights overview cards and their trends are key pieces of data to display. I will also be working on the top clusters card too.\n\n\n**Assessing Risk Clusters**\n\nI\'m now detailing the risk analysis. I\'m focusing on three specific cards: \"Vendor Concentration,\" \"Equipment Cost Variance,\" and \"Timeline Discrepancy.\" The prioritization queue will be crucial with sortable risk scores and a detailed table featuring project IDs and risk levels and actions needed. The \"Expenditure Outliers\" chart, comparing spending to physical progress, is also planned as a scatter plot. Furthermore, the Sentinel Intelligence Console, accessible via the AI assistant, is also being worked into the project.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating quick prompt cards with a two-column layout: one for analyzing delayed projects and the other for vendor concentration risk. I\'m also planning the \"Financial Trends Dashboard\" prompt, and visualizing a dynamic \"INTELLIGENCE CONTEXT\" right sidebar with data visualizations and document references. A bottom chat input with attachments and a disclaimer is also being crafted. Furthermore, I\'ve got the project details page in mind, and am adding badges, titles, and actions.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 770416880
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
