    thinking: "**Constructing Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the dashboard components, specifically starting with `IndiaRiskMap.tsx`. The goal is a \"National Risk Distribution\" section, complete with a \"VIEW DETAILS\" link. The initial design will be a high-fidelity, interactive SVG map of India, focusing on key states.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'ve been concentrating on adding interactive elements to the India Risk Map, including hover tooltips that will display state-specific data such as project totals and risk levels. I\'m also including click-to-filter functionality for deeper analysis, and incorporated a map watermark and legend. Next I will address the Financial Trends chart and the Project Status component, starting with their structures.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
