    thinking: "**Analyzing Project Directory**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting Screenshot 3 to build the Projects Page. I\'ve noted the header (\"Project Directory\"), subtitle, and action buttons. My focus is on the page\'s structure and the components needed. I\'m moving toward mapping the layout and functionality accurately.\n\n\n**Mapping Feature Interactions**\n\nI\'ve moved on to fleshing out the filter bar and data table\'s interaction. Noticed the \"Export CSV\" and \"+ New Project\" buttons; the latter triggers a modal. The multi-filter bar includes dropdowns for status, risk, year, and sector, along with \"Reset\" and \"Apply Filters\" buttons. I\'m focusing on the data table\'s columns and row data. The row data includes project IDs, names with ref codes, locations, sectors with badges, financial details with progress indicators, status & risk pills, and action buttons for each project.\n\n\n"
