  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the complete, interactive **MPLADS Sentinel** frontend application adhering strictly to the Google Stitch design system, typography, colors, and layout hierarchy.\n\n### Implemented Modules & Capabilities\n\n- **Institutional Navigation Shell & Layout**:\n  - Top navigation with the official emblem, title, search trigger with `\342\214\230K` keyboard shortcut, notification center with unread count and itemized alerts, help documentation modal, and auditor profile management.\n  - Persistent tab navigation linking all statutory oversight modules.\n  - Floating **Sentinel AI Assistant** launcher with interactive drawer access.\n\n- **Dashboard Overview (`/dashboard`)**:\n  - Six core KPI statistic cards: **Total Projects (4,520)**, **Allocated (\342\202\27112,450 Cr)**, **Expenditure (\342\202\2719,820 Cr)**, **Completed (2,100)**, **Pending (2,420)**, and **High-Risk (124)** with red accent highlights.\n  - **National Risk Distribution Map**: High-fidelity interactive SVG map of India with real-time state risk indicators, hover tooltips displaying project financials and utilization rates, state selection filters, and zoom controls.\n  - **Financial Trends**: Comparative Recharts visualization tracking quarterly allocation versus expenditure outlays.\n  - **Project Status Distribution**: Interactive progress breakdown across Completed, Ongoing, Sanctioned, and Proposed schemes with direct filtering links.\n\n- **Project Directory (`/projects`)**:\n  - Multi-parameter filter panel covering Status, Risk Level, Financial Year, and Sector categories.\n  - High-density data table presenting project IDs, reference codes, recommending MPs, district tags, financial expenditure bars, and risk scoring badges.\n  - Fully interactive pagination, search filtering, dynamic CSV export, and **New Project Registration** modal with form validation.\n\n- **Project Dossier & Forensic Audit (`/projects/:id`)**:\n  - Detailed project header for individual allocations (e.g. `PRJ-2023-4921` Ward 12 Primary Health Center).\n  - Four key metric cards: Sanctioned Amount, Released Tranche, Expenditure Incurred, and Physical Progress.\n  - **Execution Milestones & Schedule**: Step-by-step progress timeline tracking statutory sanction to handover milestones.\n  - **Sentinel Anomaly Assessment**: Forensic anomaly score gauge, itemized risk triggers (material cost inflation, progress-fund decoupling), and suggested institutional directives.\n  - **Geotagged Site Evidence**: Photographic inspection records with GPS coordinates, inspector signatures, and an **Upload Verified Evidence** modal.\n  - **Audit Provenance Trail**: Immutable log of administrative decisions, magistrate approvals, and scanner flags.\n  - **Update Status Modal**: Interactive interface for auditors to commit progress updates and inspection notes.\n\n- **Risk Analysis & Anomaly Detection (`/risk-analysis`)**:\n  - Four forensic risk KPIs and a **Run Deep Scan** trigger.\n  - **Identified Anomaly Clusters**: Groupings for vendor concentration, equipment cost variance, timeline discrepancies, and geotagging overlaps with category filters.\n  - **Progress vs. Expenditure Outliers**: Recharts scatter chart visualizing decoupled disbursements versus physical progress.\n  - **Prioritization Queue**: High-risk project inspection queue with direct links to project dossiers.\n  - **Anomaly Detection Velocity**: 30-day anomaly trend line chart.\n\n- **Geographic GIS Analysis (`/map`)**:\n  - Regional risk density overlay, state profile data cards, and itemized lists of geotagged works within the selected region.\n\n- **Audit Reports Dossier (`/reports`)**:\n  - Categorized report directory covering Financial Audits, Risk Intelligence, and Sectoral Reviews.\n  - **Generate Custom Audit Report** modal with multi-format support (PDF, Excel, CSV) and automatic document download capabilities.\n\n- **Sentinel AI Intelligence Console (`/ai-assistant`)**:\n  - RAG-grounded conversational assistant loaded with statutory guidelines, audit ledgers, and forensic anomaly criteria.\n  - One-click suggested investigation queries with structured responses containing key findings, embedded charts, affected project links, and official citation records.\n\n- **System Settings & Thresholds (`/settings`)**:\n  - Sliders for configuring material cost variance tolerances, milestone delay thresholds, GIS geofence radii, and vendor concentration caps with persistent state feedback."
    thinking: "**Verifying Prompt Compliance**\n\nOkay, so I\'ve successfully compiled and linted the applet \342\200\223 everything\'s clean on that front. Now, I\'m shifting focus to meticulously verifying each requirement from the original prompt. I\'m starting with the visual references, specifically the Stitch screenshots, to ensure design, layout, spacing, typography, colors, and the navigation structure are all preserved.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the complete, interactive **MPLADS Sentinel** frontend application adhering strictly to the Google Stitch design system, typography, colors, and layout hierarchy.\n\n### Implemented Modules & Capabilities\n\n- **Institutional Navigation Shell & Layout**:\n  - Top navigation with the official emblem, title, search trigger with `\342\214\230K` keyboard shortcut, notification center with unread count and itemized alerts, help documentation modal, and auditor profile management.\n  - Persistent tab navigation linking all statutory oversight modules.\n  - Floating **Sentinel AI Assistant** launcher with interactive drawer access.\n\n- **Dashboard Overview (`/dashboard`)**:\n  - Six core KPI statistic cards: **Total Projects (4,520)**, **Allocated (\342\202\27112,450 Cr)**, **Expenditure (\342\202\2719,820 Cr)**, **Completed (2,100)**, **Pending (2,420)**, and **High-Risk (124)** with red accent highlights.\n  - **National Risk Distribution Map**: High-fidelity interactive SVG map of India with real-time state risk indicators, hover tooltips displaying project financials and utilization rates, state selection filters, and zoom controls.\n  - **Financial Trends**: Comparative Recharts visualization tracking quarterly allocation versus expenditure outlays.\n  - **Project Status Distribution**: Interactive progress breakdown across Completed, Ongoing, Sanctioned, and Proposed schemes with direct filtering links.\n\n- **Project Directory (`/projects`)**:\n  - Multi-parameter filter panel covering Status, Risk Level, Financial Year, and Sector categories.\n  - High-density data table presenting project IDs, reference codes, recommending MPs, district tags, financial expenditure bars, and risk scoring badges.\n  - Fully interactive pagination, search filtering, dynamic CSV export, and **New Project Registration** modal with form validation.\n\n- **Project Dossier & Forensic Audit (`/projects/:id`)**:\n  - Detailed project header for individual allocations (e.g. `PRJ-2023-4921` Ward 12 Primary Health Center).\n  - Four key metric cards: Sanctioned Amount, Released Tranche, Expenditure Incurred, and Physical Progress.\n  - **Execution Milestones & Schedule**: Step-by-step progress timeline tracking statutory sanction to handover milestones.\n  - **Sentinel Anomaly Assessment**: Forensic anomaly score gauge, itemized risk triggers (material cost inflation, progress-fund decoupling), and suggested institutional directives.\n  - **Geotagged Site Evidence**: Photographic inspection records with GPS coordinates, inspector signatures, and an **Upload Verified Evidence** modal.\n  - **Audit Provenance Trail**: Immutable log of administrative decisions, magistrate approvals, and scanner flags.\n  - **Update Status Modal**: Interactive interface for auditors to commit progress updates and inspection notes.\n\n- **Risk Analysis & Anomaly Detection (`/risk-analysis`)**:\n  - Four forensic risk KPIs and a **Run Deep Scan** trigger.\n  - **Identified Anomaly Clusters**: Groupings for vendor concentration, equipment cost variance, timeline discrepancies, and geotagging overlaps with category filters.\n  - **Progress vs. Expenditure Outliers**: Recharts scatter chart visualizing decoupled disbursements versus physical progress.\n  - **Prioritization Queue**: High-risk project inspection queue with direct links to project dossiers.\n  - **Anomaly Detection Velocity**: 30-day anomaly trend line chart.\n\n- **Geographic GIS Analysis (`/map`)**:\n  - Regional risk density overlay, state profile data cards, and itemized lists of geotagged works within the selected region.\n\n- **Audit Reports Dossier (`/reports`)**:\n  - Categorized report directory covering Financial Audits, Risk Intelligence, and Sectoral Reviews.\n  - **Generate Custom Audit Report** modal with multi-format support (PDF, Excel, CSV) and automatic document download capabilities.\n\n- **Sentinel AI Intelligence Console (`/ai-assistant`)**:\n  - RAG-grounded conversational assistant loaded with statutory guidelines, audit ledgers, and forensic anomaly criteria.\n  - One-click suggested investigation queries with structured responses containing key findings, embedded charts, affected project links, and official citation records.\n\n- **System Settings & Thresholds (`/settings`)**:\n  - Sliders for configuring material cost variance tolerances, milestone delay thresholds, GIS geofence radii, and vendor concentration caps with persistent state feedback."
