  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating Mobile Design**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on the hamburger sidebar implementation and achieving pixel-perfect, intuitive mobile responsiveness. I\'m thinking of designing a dedicated `MobileSidebar.tsx` component to handle this elegantly.\n\n\n**Designing Mobile Sidebar**\n\nI\'ve been working on a smooth, animated off-canvas drawer that blurs the backdrop, and I\'m integrating several key elements. The design includes an institutional header, quick stats ticker, an interactive search input, rich navigation with icons and indicators, and a direct link to the Sentinel AI Console. I\'m also including an auditor profile snippet and ensuring touch-friendly targets with smooth transitions and auto-close functionality. I\'m also testing header and navigation sticky behaviour.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating critical elements across the dashboard and projects pages to optimize the mobile user experience. For the Dashboard, I\'m adapting the filter bar for responsive layout and ensuring the grid cards maintain proper spacing on smaller screens. I am refining the SVG map interaction and creating responsive charts. On the Projects page, I\'m implementing collapsible filters and a horizontally scrollable table with a card view alternative for mobile screens. I\'m also ensuring the table is easily scrollable.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 475791639
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
