  planner_response {
    response: "I have updated the application to be **fully responsive for mobile devices** and implemented a dedicated **hamburger sidebar navigation drawer**:\n\n- **Off-Canvas Hamburger Sidebar Drawer**:\n  - Integrated a responsive sidebar with backdrop blur and smooth sliding animation for smaller screens (`lg:hidden`).\n  - Contains institutional branding, search shortcut, a direct access link to the **Sentinel AI Console**, navigational modules with live badges (e.g., *124 High Risk* alert tag), quick institutional tools (*Register Project*, *Audit Manual & FAQ*), and the **Auditor Profile** footer with MoSPI nodal access status.\n  - Automatically locks background scrolling when active, closes on route navigation or backdrop click, and supports `Escape` key handling.\n\n- **Responsive Mobile Header**:\n  - Adjusted the top navigation bar with a hamburger menu trigger, touch-friendly icons, compact search button, notification center with unread count pill, and auditor avatar.\n\n- **Mobile Scheme Cards & Fluid Grids**:\n  - Enhanced the **Project Directory** with touch-optimized cards on mobile screens (`block md:hidden`), displaying sector badges, risk levels, financial expenditure progress bars, and MP/district data directly without requiring awkward horizontal table scrolling.\n  - Ensured all metrics grids, filters, modal dialogues, GIS maps, and AI chat views scale cleanly across all phone and tablet screen resolutions."
    modified_response: "I have updated the application to be **fully responsive for mobile devices** and implemented a dedicated **hamburger sidebar navigation drawer**:\n\n- **Off-Canvas Hamburger Sidebar Drawer**:\n  - Integrated a responsive sidebar with backdrop blur and smooth sliding animation for smaller screens (`lg:hidden`).\n  - Contains institutional branding, search shortcut, a direct access link to the **Sentinel AI Console**, navigational modules with live badges (e.g., *124 High Risk* alert tag), quick institutional tools (*Register Project*, *Audit Manual & FAQ*), and the **Auditor Profile** footer with MoSPI nodal access status.\n  - Automatically locks background scrolling when active, closes on route navigation or backdrop click, and supports `Escape` key handling.\n\n- **Responsive Mobile Header**:\n  - Adjusted the top navigation bar with a hamburger menu trigger, touch-friendly icons, compact search button, notification center with unread count pill, and auditor avatar.\n\n- **Mobile Scheme Cards & Fluid Grids**:\n  - Enhanced the **Project Directory** with touch-optimized cards on mobile screens (`block md:hidden`), displaying sector badges, risk levels, financial expenditure progress bars, and MP/district data directly without requiring awkward horizontal table scrolling.\n  - Ensured all metrics grids, filters, modal dialogues, GIS maps, and AI chat views scale cleanly across all phone and tablet screen resolutions."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1788026511
      nanos: 439857966
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "do these features"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a Gemini chatbot\"\nicon: \"voice_chat\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add a multi-turn chat interface to the app using Gemini. The chat must maintain conversation history, display messages in a scrollable thread, and include a system instruction to give the chatbots specific roles. Use gemini-3.1-pro-preview for particularly complex tasks, gemini-3.5-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Use Google Maps data\"\nicon: \"google_pin\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Maps Grounding to the app where relevant to get up to date and accurate information. Use gemini-3.5-flash (with googleMaps tool)"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add database and auth\"\nlogoUrl: \"https://www.gstatic.com/mobilesdk/250721_mobilesdk/mono_firebase_dark.svg\"\n---\n\nYou MUST connect the app to Firebase. Add functionality that uses Google Sign-in with Firebase Auth to securely identify users, and add data persistence to keep track of user data with Firestore."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Create & edit images\"\nicon: \"image_edit_auto\"\n---\n\nAdd functionality to the app for users to use text prompts to create or edit images using gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add voice conversations\"\nicon: \"audio_spark\"\n---\n\nAdd functionality to the app for users to use model gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview (Live API) in their app. This will allow users to have a conversation with the app and get responses from Live API in real-time."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Animate images into video\"\nicon: \"movie\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add the ability for users to upload a photo and then generate a video using Veo video generations. Use model: veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview, the generated video must have an aspect ratio of `16:9` (landscape) or `9:16` (portrait)."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Use Google Search data\"\nicon: \"google\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Search Grounding to the app where relevant to get up to date and accurate information. Use gemini-3.5-flash (with googleSearch tool)"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "do these features"
    }
  }
}
