  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the complete suite of **Gemini AI Multimodal & Grounded Intelligence** features within Sentinel:\n\n### 1. Multi-Turn Gemini Investigative Chatbot\n- **Dynamic Model Selection**:\n  - `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`: Configured for deep complex forensic audits, contractor collusion analysis, and cross-district anomaly pattern detection.\n  - `gemini-3.5-flash`: Configured for general scheme analytics, status summaries, and ledger queries.\n  - `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`: Configured for ultra-fast instant record lookups and budget math.\n- **Scrollable Conversation Thread**: Retains multi-turn conversation history with markdown formatting, syntax highlighting, and copy-to-clipboard actions.\n- **Role-Based System Instructions**: Preset personas for *Lead Forensic Auditor*, *GIS & Field Verifier*, and *MoSPI Compliance Officer*.\n- **Voice Briefings**: Integrated text-to-speech narration using `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview` for audio briefings.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Google Maps Grounding (`gemini-3.5-flash`)\n- Grounded geospatial intelligence utilizing the `googleMaps` tool.\n- Verified place extraction with Google Maps links (`groundingChunks.maps.uri`), municipal infrastructure proximity checks, and GPS coordinate retrieval.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Google Search Grounding (`gemini-3.5-flash`)\n- Live web-grounded research utilizing the `googleSearch` tool.\n- Displays interactive web citation cards with source URLs, national gazette notices, and search query pills.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Image Creation & Editing Studio (`gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview`)\n- **Text-to-Image Generation**: Synthesizes 3D civil architectural blueprints, healthcare renders, and community hall mockups.\n- **Site Photo Editing**: Upload or select project photos to simulate infrastructure upgrades (e.g., adding rooftop solar panels, paving roads, or highlighting structural anomalies).\n- **Aspect Ratio Control**: Supports `16:9`, `4:3`, `1:1`, `3:4`, and `9:16` formats with high-resolution PNG download.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Veo Video Studio (`veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview`)\n- **Image-to-Video Animation**: Converts still site milestone photos into cinematic 3D drone flyovers and architectural inspections.\n- **Aspect Ratios**: Supports `16:9` (landscape) and `9:16` (portrait) at `720p` or `1080p`.\n- **Progress Tracking & Player**: Built-in polling with reassuring status notifications, looping video player, and MP4 download.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Live Voice Room (`gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview`)\n- **Real-Time Two-Way Audio**: Low-latency voice streaming via WebSocket (`/ws/live`).\n- **Audio Pipeline**: 16,000 Hz 16-bit PCM microphone capture with 24,000 Hz model playback.\n- **Audio Visualizer**: Animated glowing visualizer orb with speaker energy detection and instant interruption recovery."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Successful Build**\n\nNow that the build is complete, I\'m carefully reviewing the implemented features. I\'m focusing on ensuring everything meets the specifications precisely. Specifically, I\'m checking the multi-turn chatbot\'s conversation history and role-specific system instructions, making sure everything works as intended.\n\n\n**Defining Model Selection**\n\nI\'ve been defining the dynamic model selection process, using different Gemini models based on task complexity. For instance, I\'ll leverage `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` for complex forensic reasoning and `gemini-3.5-flash` for general tasks. Ultra-fast instant lookups will rely on `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, and rich markdown rendering will use `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview`. Next, I\'ll be working on integrating Google Maps and Search grounding functions.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have implemented the complete suite of **Gemini AI Multimodal & Grounded Intelligence** features within Sentinel:\n\n### 1. Multi-Turn Gemini Investigative Chatbot\n- **Dynamic Model Selection**:\n  - `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`: Configured for deep complex forensic audits, contractor collusion analysis, and cross-district anomaly pattern detection.\n  - `gemini-3.5-flash`: Configured for general scheme analytics, status summaries, and ledger queries.\n  - `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`: Configured for ultra-fast instant record lookups and budget math.\n- **Scrollable Conversation Thread**: Retains multi-turn conversation history with markdown formatting, syntax highlighting, and copy-to-clipboard actions.\n- **Role-Based System Instructions**: Preset personas for *Lead Forensic Auditor*, *GIS & Field Verifier*, and *MoSPI Compliance Officer*.\n- **Voice Briefings**: Integrated text-to-speech narration using `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview` for audio briefings.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Google Maps Grounding (`gemini-3.5-flash`)\n- Grounded geospatial intelligence utilizing the `googleMaps` tool.\n- Verified place extraction with Google Maps links (`groundingChunks.maps.uri`), municipal infrastructure proximity checks, and GPS coordinate retrieval.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Google Search Grounding (`gemini-3.5-flash`)\n- Live web-grounded research utilizing the `googleSearch` tool.\n- Displays interactive web citation cards with source URLs, national gazette notices, and search query pills.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Image Creation & Editing Studio (`gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview`)\n- **Text-to-Image Generation**: Synthesizes 3D civil architectural blueprints, healthcare renders, and community hall mockups.\n- **Site Photo Editing**: Upload or select project photos to simulate infrastructure upgrades (e.g., adding rooftop solar panels, paving roads, or highlighting structural anomalies).\n- **Aspect Ratio Control**: Supports `16:9`, `4:3`, `1:1`, `3:4`, and `9:16` formats with high-resolution PNG download.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Veo Video Studio (`veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview`)\n- **Image-to-Video Animation**: Converts still site milestone photos into cinematic 3D drone flyovers and architectural inspections.\n- **Aspect Ratios**: Supports `16:9` (landscape) and `9:16` (portrait) at `720p` or `1080p`.\n- **Progress Tracking & Player**: Built-in polling with reassuring status notifications, looping video player, and MP4 download.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Live Voice Room (`gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview`)\n- **Real-Time Two-Way Audio**: Low-latency voice streaming via WebSocket (`/ws/live`).\n- **Audio Pipeline**: 16,000 Hz 16-bit PCM microphone capture with 24,000 Hz model playback.\n- **Audio Visualizer**: Animated glowing visualizer orb with speaker energy detection and instant interruption recovery."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 187417379
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
